  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "Disney led these seven choices over five years. Apple and Coca-Cola also rose strongly, while both broad share baskets gained less than those three companies. This window does not prove that picking individual stocks is easy. You only learn which ones did best after living through the risks, including the 1987 market crash.",
