  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "People followed computer networks, the return of Halley’s comet and repeated disputes over government borrowing.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "Company shares, bonds and broad baskets compounded differently. Spreading money across many companies reduced dependence on any single business, even when it missed the biggest gain.",
    "what_faded_away": "The exact timing of a debt-limit extension did not provide a five-year market forecast. The comet’s brightness did not either.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "Disney’s leading return was not printed in its movie reviews. Knowing the final winner now makes the decision look easier than it was.",
